@startuml
!theme plain
title TASK-260715-30zng6 — M1 extension-owned component boundaries
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Containing app (not live data path)" #F3F3F3 {
  [Profile / VPN manager] as App
}

package "Packet tunnel extension" #EAF2FF {
  [iOS or macOS provider root] as Root
  [TunnelProviderAdapter\nactor] as Provider
  [TunnelRuntimeCoordinator\nactor; one generation] as Coord
  [RuntimeSnapshotStore\nimmutable publication] as Snapshot

  package "Injected platform seams" #FFF2CC {
    [ConfigurationSnapshotSource] as Config
    [PacketFlow] as PacketFlow
    [NetworkSettingsPlanBuilder] as SettingsBuilder
    [NetworkSettingsApplier] as SettingsApplier
  }

  package "Generation-owned mandatory M1 sessions" #D9EAD3 {
    [SSHBootstrapSession / SSHTransport\nbaseline single session] as SSH
    [TCPConsumer\naccepted CONNECT flows] as TCP
    [DNSConsumer / VirtualDNSIngress\nSSH-only upstream] as DNS
    [M1PacketPlaneSession\nprivate SOCKS owner + dispatcher] as Plane
    [PacketFlowBridge\nendpoint A + pumps] as Bridge
    [HEV supervisor\ndedicated thread + lease] as HEV
  }

  package "Future seams — inactive in M1" #F4CCCC {
    [DatagramCapabilitySession\nM2 UDP] as UDP
    [SSHSessionProvider\nM3 lanes] as Lanes
    [RuntimeRecoveryPolicy\nM3 reconnect] as Recovery
    [RoutePolicy\nM3 fail-closed] as RoutePolicy
  }
}

App --> Root : system VPN start/stop\nversioned read-only messages
Root --> Provider : lifecycle callbacks
Provider --> Coord : constructs/starts/stops one generation
Provider --> Snapshot : read immutable response
Coord --> Snapshot : sole writer; generation + sequence
Coord --> Config : atomic non-secret load
Coord --> SSH : resolve, verify, authenticate before routes
Coord --> TCP : prepare/stop; baseline direct-tcpip
Coord --> DNS : prepare/stop; safe DNS readiness
Coord --> Plane : pure preflight before routes\nPacketBridge.start after apply
Coord --> SettingsBuilder : actual endpoint + bound M0 values
Coord --> SettingsApplier : apply/clear; await completion
Plane --> Bridge : owns one run
Bridge --> PacketFlow : public packet reads/writes
Bridge --> HEV : exclusive descriptor-B borrow
HEV --> Plane : authenticated private SOCKS channel
Plane --> TCP : validated CONNECT
Plane --> DNS : virtual-DNS UDP/TCP only\nreject other UDP in M1
TCP --> SSH : direct-tcpip only
DNS --> SSH : DNS-over-TCP only

Coord ..> UDP : optional later contribution; absent
Coord ..> Lanes : single-session implementation only
Coord ..> Recovery : M1 always stopGeneration
SettingsBuilder ..> RoutePolicy : compatible only in M1

note bottom of Coord
  Sole writer of generation, state,
  acquisition stack, routesInstalled,
  cancellation and snapshot sequence.
end note

note bottom of App
  Never owns live packet, HEV, SSH,
  TCP, DNS, route or coordinator state.
end note
@enduml
